IhrxfQ0SWJ9E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_pVbxnvm2urRPFYc2uZ6r_mK1keXjVks4A0ol8dICF9A&oe=6A3BE819"}, {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "1739366730778256", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619382_1739366734111589_8186870986444138126_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xqg_cNAh56UQ7kNvwGq8DAp&_nc_oc=AdpUHKz4Asg9drWBaehbwPjdnd2Z1evgTsdEBcM7ZA7quNgB0Cu8YyT16E8-dR9V-RE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8hqvUhRpoIydrZn3MaEKAqEOSbkWznTDcTtOdCeRA_Ng&oe=6A3C030F"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1561283672379004", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618102_1561283675712337_8363921898065324878_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SZkAEhOnppkQ7kNvwEbHrH1&_nc_oc=Adqu4LCphd3rOdsKEXwk4vxAE9wHZFgcCekANBiTOgGf_Ab0ZLKqWeHZnT_64cpeTHg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_AqkP-nb4c-IGMiJkCqorHyvsqFIbmTu1jHyzfCJOsgA&oe=6A3BF441"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "3475002012649489", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_3475002019316155_6224022519921264569_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2SGqrFmVzzwQ7kNvwF5j2TD&_nc_oc=AdqkoIyR57HT0q1sNg9JquLdq1IsLBIKG4UOrPmeKg3lLT10OWiwYFZRDfBbJ8HixKU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9n2W_heIfHPqom7RMMerO9wDOq6Az5poZqUvONf8t3IA&oe=6A3BDB85"}, "display_name": "Vocab Clash", "keywords": ["learning", "vocabulary", "English", "Chinese", "sport"], "long_description": "Vocab Clash is a VR immersive learning tool that fuses vocabulary acquisition with full-body movement. It supports both English and Chinese learning tracks, featuring image-based questions, video-based questions, and fill-in-the-blank questions. Through an intuitive \"understand first, then answer with your body\" mechanism, learners build direct concept-to-vocabulary neural connections across boxing, darts, table tennis, escape-adventure levels, and AI-powered real-time voice role-play.\nThe system covers nearly 8,000 English words for TOEFL and IELTS, as well as nearly 8,000 Chinese vocabulary entries. Each entry includes a dedicated image and contextual example sentence.\n\nUnlike traditional memorization tools, the game shows no translations or dictionary definitions. Instead, meaning is conveyed through three question types:\nImage Questions \u2014 Observe purely visual images and infer the concept they express.\nVideo Questions \u2014 Watch short clips and grasp word meaning within dynamic scenarios.\nFill-in-the-Blank Questions \u2014 Supply the missing word based on sentence context.\n\nYour response is not a button press. It is full-body movement:\n\nBoxing \u2014 Punch the correct answer in the ring.\nDarts \u2014 Throw darts to hit the target option at the range.\nTable Tennis \u2014 Swing your paddle and drive the ball toward the correct answer.\nAdventure Escape \u2014 Answer questions to seal monsters while dodging pursuit at high speed.\nAI Battle \u2014 Compete against AI opponents in real-time vocabulary duels.\nEv", "short_description": "Vocab Clash is a VR immersive learning tool that deeply integrates vocabulary learning with full-body movement. It supports both English learning and Chinese learning, Through connections across multiple motion-based scenarios such as boxing, darts, table tennis, adventure escape levels, This system covers nearly 8,000 English words for TOEFL and IELTS, as well as nearly 8,000 Chinese vocabulary entries. Each entry includes a dedicated image and contextual example sentence."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://zp1412042552-hue.github.io/vocab-clash-website/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ZP Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://zp1412042552-hue.github.io/vocab-clash-website/", "category": null